109
00:05:13,700 --> 00:05:14,633
[Sad]
I guessed right!

110
00:05:25,000 --> 00:05:26,900
Interesting.

111
00:05:26,900 --> 00:05:28,833
Interesting.

112
00:05:29,000 --> 00:05:30,466
