180
00:07:52,400 --> 00:07:54,866
Lakers! You play basketball?

181
00:07:54,866 --> 00:07:58,000
I can sing, dance, rap,
and play basketball.

182
00:07:58,033 --> 00:07:59,866
[What a coincidence!]
We've got the same vibe.

183
00:07:59,866 --> 00:08:00,700
Yeah.

184
00:08:00,700 --> 00:08:01,366
Okay.

185
00:08:03,133 --> 00:08:05,166
