230
00:09:18,433 --> 00:09:20,966
I really enjoyed it.

231
00:09:25,400 --> 00:09:28,533
Zhang Xuefei, please head
to the date zone.

232
00:09:28,533 --> 00:09:31,533
Zhang Xuefei, please head
to the date zone.

