me.

1939
01:10:57,700 --> 01:10:58,300
Me.

1940
01:11:04,133 --> 01:11:06,666
If I had seen you talk like this,

1941
01:11:06,700 --> 01:11:08,100
actually,

1942
01:11:08,100 --> 01:11:10,233
I would've wanted

1943
01:11:10,266 --> 01:11:11,800
to…

1944
01:11:11,833 --> 01:11:15,166
get to know you a bit more.

1945
01:11:15,200 --> 01:11:16,433
What do you mean?

1946
01:11:16,433 --> 01:11:18,066
I thought you weren't serious.

1947
01:11:18,066 --> 01:11:20,133
You were just joking around all day.

1948
01:11:20,133 --> 01:11:21,600
I felt like when you talked,

1949
01:11:21,633 --> 01:11:23,366
every word was just an act.

1950
01:11:23,400 --> 01:11:25,866
And every time you spoke,
I just wanted to laugh.

1951
01:11:25,866 --> 01:11:27,566
It's true that some things I said
weren't serious,

1952
01:11:27,600 --> 01:11:30,266
but as long as everyone is happy
with what I say,

1953
01:11:30,266 --> 01:11:32,700
that's fine by me.

1954
01:11:37,833 --> 01:11:39,133
I think…

1955
01:11:41,866 --> 01:11:44,066
love…

1956
01:11:44,066 --> 01:11:45,900
isn't that simple,

1957
01:11:45,900 --> 01:11:49,200
nor is it that easy.

1958
01:11:50,200 --> 01:11:52,700
I don't want to recklessly

1959
01:11:52,700 --> 01:11:55,900
or easily make that kind of decision.

1960
01:11:55,900 --> 01:11:57,133
Every time I think

1961
01:11:57,133 --> 01:11:58,800
about the moments we've shared
these past two days,

1962
01:11:58,833 --> 01:12:00,366
many are from a friend's perspective

1963
01:12:00,400 --> 01:12:01,333
when I look back.

1964
01:12:01,333 --> 01:12:01,966
But

1965
01:12:02,000 --> 01:12:03,333
when getting to know any girl,

1966
01:12:03,333 --> 01:12:05,266
it always starts with being friends.

1967
01:12:05,300 --> 01:12:07,900
I was even more confused
than you were yesterday.

1968
01:12:22,433 --> 01:12:23,566
Then you…

1969
01:12:26,600 --> 01:12:27,600
Never mind.

1970
01:12:29,700 --> 01:12:33,433
If I'm still on the island tomorrow,

1971
01:12:33,466 --> 01:12:35,466
[Promise]
we're still chatting here,

1972
01:12:35,466 --> 01:12:36,500
[Promise]
okay?

1973
01:12:36,500 --> 01:12:38,400
[Promise]

1974
01:12:39,433 --> 01:12:39,933
What do you mean?

1975
01:12:39,933 --> 01:12:42,966
[Leave it to tomorrow.]
Let's worry about tomorrow tomorrow.

1976
01:12:43,000 --> 01:12:43,466
I'm heading back.

1977
01:12:44,866 --> 01:12:46,133
Leaving already?

1978
01:12:46,133 --> 01:12:46,600
Let's go.

1979
01:13:09,033 --> 01:13:11,466
I'm really torn, don't know who to pick.

1980
01:13:11,466 --> 01:13:12,600
I haven't had

1981
01:13:12,633 --> 01:13:15,166
any deep connections with anyone.

1982
01:13:16,300 --> 01:13:17,100
Kong (Kong Xichen) was standing here.

1983
01:13:17,100 --> 01:13:18,333
Kelvin (Kelvin Wang)
was squatting over there.

1984
01:13:18,333 --> 01:13:21,366
Kelvin Wang and Pu Yanyan have teamed up.

1985
01:13:24,100 --> 01:13:24,966
Hello, partner.

1986
01:13:27,700 --> 01:13:28,800
What are you going to make?

1987
01:13:28,833 --> 01:13:29,866
Sweet and Sour Spareribs.

1988
01:13:29,866 --> 01:13:31,000
I like Sweet and Sour Spareribs.

1989
01:13:31,033 --> 01:13:32,233
Is it difficult for you?

1990
01:13:32,233 --> 01:13:33,833
It's okay for me.

1991
01:13:33,833 --> 01:13:35,366
Maybe it feels a bit too rushed.

1992
01:13:35,400 --> 01:13:36,266
I feel the same way.

1993
01:13:38,933 --> 01:13:40,833
[One Moonstone from Kong Xichen
to Sun Shuo]

1994
01:13:46,233 --> 01:13:47,033
I voted for them

1995
01:13:47,033 --> 01:13:49,500
just because my interactions with them

1996
01:13:49,500 --> 01:13:52,100
were slightly more

1997
01:13:52,100 --> 01:13:53,100
than with the other guys.

1998
01:14:33,400 --> 01:14:35,666
When I saw them all chatting with others,

1999
01:14:35,666 --> 01:14:38,800
and I went to find someone alone,

2000
01:14:38,833 --> 01:14:41,133
I stood there for a moment and watched.

2001
01:14:41,133 --> 01:14:44,233
I had a moment of this…

2002
01:14:44,266 --> 01:14:45,966
depression.

2003
01:14:46,000 --> 01:14:48,000
Yeah, I thought maybe I should
take a walk, too.

2004
01:14:48,000 --> 01:14:48,733
I'll go take a walk, too.

2005
01:14:48,733 --> 01:14:49,866
Where are you going?

2006
01:14:49,900 --> 01:14:51,166
I'm taking a walk, too.

2007
01:14:52,266 --> 01:14:52,866
Just that.

2008
01:14:57,466 --> 01:14:58,000
Hello.

2009
01:14:58,033 --> 01:14:59,133
Hello, go on.

2010
01:15:04,466 --> 01:15:05,300
Nice spot.

2011
01:15:10,633 --> 01:15:11,966
I haven't had a chance to interact

2012
01:15:12,000 --> 01:15:13,133
with the one I want to get to know.

2013
01:15:13,133 --> 01:15:14,666
I'll go call her out for you now

2014
01:15:14,700 --> 01:15:16,000
so you can have your chance, bro.

2015
01:15:16,033 --> 01:15:17,100
Buddies look out for each other.

2016
01:15:17,100 --> 01:15:18,300
I'll go invite her for you.

2017
01:15:18,300 --> 01:15:19,133
Who did you pick (in the quadrant)?

2018
01:15:19,133 --> 01:15:20,800
I didn't pick anyone.

2019
01:15:20,833 --> 01:15:22,900
Probably because of my personality

2020
01:15:22,900 --> 01:15:24,400
and various reasons,

2021
01:15:24,433 --> 01:15:26,000
[Ma Haoxiang]
I just don't have anyone

2022
01:15:26,000 --> 01:15:27,400
[I had some relationships,]
I particularly like.

2023
01:15:27,433 --> 01:15:31,033
[but I still don't get love.]
I also didn't have

2024
01:15:31,033 --> 01:15:33,100
the intention of looking for someone.

2025
01:15:33,100 --> 01:15:34,400
[Choose Carefully]

2026
01:15:34,433 --> 01:15:36,533
Who would you be more interested in?

2027
01:15:37,600 --> 01:15:39,933
No particular…

2028
01:15:39,933 --> 01:15:40,600
preference.

2029
01:15:48,400 --> 01:15:49,066
Remember what I said?

2030
01:15:49,066 --> 01:15:50,333
I'm the male lead here.

2031
01:15:52,933 --> 01:15:55,966
[One Moonstone from Ma Haoxiang
to Kong Xichen]

2032
01:16:01,933 --> 01:16:03,433
[Two Moonstones from Ma Haoxiang to]
Have you just met

2033
01:16:03,466 --> 01:16:03,933
[Zhang Xuefei]
now?

2034
01:16:03,933 --> 01:16:04,666
We knew each other before.

2035
01:16:04,700 --> 01:16:05,400
I don't believe it.

2036
01:16:07,133 --> 01:16:07,766
Seriously.

2037
01:16:12,300 --> 01:16:13,166
[One Moonstone from Ma Haoxiang
to Autumn]

2038
01:16:13,200 --> 01:16:14,300
If you make it real,

2039
01:16:14,300 --> 01:16:15,566
it's epic.

2040
01:16:26,333 --> 01:16:30,566
[One Moonstone Left]

2041
01:16:49,300 --> 01:16:53,633
[Two Moonstones from Ma Haoxiang
to Autumn]

2042
01:17:01,800 --> 01:17:02,266
[Tonight,]

2043
01:17:02,266 --> 01:17:03,766
[the moon holds all the answers.]

2044
01:17:03,800 --> 01:17:06,333
[It watches silently
who gets fate's favor,]

2045
01:17:06,333 --> 01:17:08,233
[who gets swept away by the tide,]

2046
01:17:08,266 --> 01:17:09,933
[with the marks they've made left.]

2047
01:17:11,100 --> 01:17:12,700
Today, some islanders

2048
01:17:12,700 --> 01:17:14,300
will bid farewell
to the journey of affection.

2049
01:17:14,300 --> 01:17:15,333
[Day of Departure Day 3]

2050
01:17:16,633 --> 01:17:18,066
Your journey of affection

2051
01:17:18,066 --> 01:17:19,600
is temporarily coming to an end.

2052
01:17:20,800 --> 01:17:21,666
[I don't want to continue.]

2053
01:17:21,666 --> 01:17:23,300
[I don't want to continue.]
So annoying.

2054
01:17:23,300 --> 01:17:26,433
Didn't get enough affection.

2055
01:17:26,466 --> 01:17:28,300
No mood, whatever.

2056
01:17:28,300 --> 01:17:29,600
Fine, I'll leave.

2057
01:17:29,633 --> 01:17:31,100
He/She secretly told me yesterday

2058
01:17:31,100 --> 01:17:32,166
that he/she fell in love.

2059
01:17:32,200 --> 01:17:33,266
I'd like to call 'mine'.

2060
01:17:33,266 --> 01:17:34,566
I'd rather just be friends with you.

2061
01:17:36,666 --> 01:17:38,100
[Next Episode]
It's a pity to say goodbye

2062
01:17:38,100 --> 01:17:39,100
[Next Episode]
to everyone for now.

2063
01:17:39,100 --> 01:17:39,800
Very sad.

2064
01:17:39,833 --> 01:17:40,433
Upset.

2065
01:17:41,833 --> 01:17:42,933
Feeling a bit emotional right now.

2066
01:17:42,933 --> 01:17:44,266
I choose not to answer.

2067
01:17:44,300 --> 01:17:46,300
It puts a lot of pressure on me.

2068
01:17:46,300 --> 01:17:47,933
We barely communicated.

2069
01:17:47,933 --> 01:17:49,566
Today, I witnessed

2070
01:17:49,600 --> 01:17:51,066
a very beautiful love story.

2071
01:17:51,066 --> 01:17:52,666
You also remind me of someone.

2072
01:17:52,666 --> 01:17:53,733
Someone I'd like to call 'mine'.

2073
01:17:53,733 --> 01:17:55,733
You're so smooth.

2074
01:17:55,733 --> 01:17:57,566
During competitions, I really want to win.

2075
01:17:57,600 --> 01:17:59,066
The only thing on my mind was

2076
01:17:59,066 --> 01:18:00,166
not to let my teammate down.

2077
01:18:00,200 --> 01:18:01,433
I'll definitely choose Pu Yanyan

2078
01:18:01,433 --> 01:18:04,166
and experience
that winning feeling together.

2079
01:18:04,200 --> 01:18:06,400
I want to get first place
for Xiaxia (Xia Boyan).

2080
01:18:06,400 --> 01:18:08,133
I want to find a chance to tell her.

2081
01:18:08,133 --> 01:18:09,366
I really like his personality.

2082
01:18:09,400 --> 01:18:11,833
I have feelings for him.

2083
01:18:11,833 --> 01:18:13,333
I went all-in for one girl.

2084
01:18:13,333 --> 01:18:14,800
If she doesn't vote for me,

2085
01:18:14,833 --> 01:18:16,066
and no one votes for me, I'll leave.

2086
01:18:16,066 --> 01:18:17,800
I never know which of your words are true

2087
01:18:17,833 --> 01:18:18,700
and which are false.

2088
01:18:18,700 --> 01:18:20,366
Don't you want to meet more girls?

2089
01:18:20,400 --> 01:18:22,433
I feel like you still have other options.

2090
01:18:22,433 --> 01:18:24,066
I'm just scared to take that step.

2091
01:18:24,066 --> 01:18:27,000
So you always wait for girls
to make the first move?

2092
01:18:27,033 --> 01:18:28,166
You know, I gave Ma a Moonstone

2093
01:18:28,200 --> 01:18:28,866
every day

2094
01:18:28,866 --> 01:18:29,866
because I think he's really handsome.

2095
01:18:29,866 --> 01:18:31,000
Date…

2096
01:18:31,033 --> 01:18:32,066
I'm coming!

2097
01:18:32,066 --> 01:18:33,300
What do you think of me? Do you like me?

2098
01:18:39,033 --> 01:18:40,333
[Preview of Affection Diaries]
In 24 hours,

2099
01:18:40,333 --> 01:18:42,200
[Preview of Affection Diaries]
someone will regretfully leave the island.

2100
01:18:42,233 --> 01:18:43,666
[Preview of Affection Diaries]
The battle for survival begins.

2101
01:18:43,666 --> 01:18:44,666
So brutal.

2102
01:18:44,666 --> 01:18:45,600
Between love and practicality,

2103
01:18:45,633 --> 01:18:46,700
it's really a tough choice.

2104
01:18:46,700 --> 01:18:49,100
When you meet someone you like,
you get nervous.

2105
01:18:49,100 --> 01:18:50,833
I think she lacks confidence a bit.

2106
01:18:50,866 --> 01:18:52,100
Get to know each other before deciding.

2107
01:18:52,100 --> 01:18:53,500
- No rush to conclusions.
- Right.

2108
01:18:53,500 --> 01:18:54,800
I have something to say.

2109
01:18:55,533 --> 01:18:56,033
It goes official.

2110
01:19:01,033 --> 01:19:02,766
Why?

2111
01:19:02,800 --> 01:19:04,433
Why are guys all like this?

2112
01:19:04,433 --> 01:19:06,500
Totally unscripted.

2113
01:19:08,633 --> 01:19:10,966
I know those editors. They're sneaky.

2114
01:19:11,000 --> 01:19:11,633
Sorry.

2115
01:19:12,133 --> 01:19:12,733
Chat first.

2116
01:19:15,066 --> 01:19:16,100
Oh, that looking back.

2117
01:19:16,100 --> 01:19:17,000
I don't know.

2118
01:19:17,033 --> 01:19:18,633
I've never seen Jackline on a date.

2119
01:19:18,633 --> 01:19:19,700
I'm a little scared.

2120
01:19:20,500 --> 01:19:22,433
They seem to have serious chemistry.

2121
01:19:22,866 --> 01:19:23,700
What do they say?

2122
01:19:23,700 --> 01:19:25,400
Red and blue make a pair.

2123
01:19:25,433 --> 01:19:26,933
It's so fun watching their little game.

2124
01:19:28,100 --> 01:19:29,800
Attention, all islanders.

2125
01:19:29,833 --> 01:19:31,866
'Moon of Affection' is now lit.

2126
01:19:32,233 --> 01:19:34,100
Tonight will be exciting.

2127
01:19:35,600 --> 01:19:36,900
So nervous.

2128
01:19:36,900 --> 01:19:38,100
Should give a Moonstone to Jackline.

2129
01:19:38,100 --> 01:19:38,733
She probably went all-in.

2130
01:19:38,733 --> 01:19:40,166
Isn't this just like Jiang?

2131
01:19:40,200 --> 01:19:42,333
Never changed from start to finish.

2132
01:19:42,333 --> 01:19:44,200
Two days is indeed too short

2133
01:19:44,233 --> 01:19:46,566
to be so invested in one person.

2134
01:19:47,133 --> 01:19:47,866
I don't think he can choose.

2135
01:19:47,900 --> 01:19:48,533
What's his choice?
